{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17630","headline":"斋中有兽皮茵偶成咏 · 羊士谔","name":"斋中有兽皮茵偶成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逸才岂凡兽，服猛愚人得。\n山泽生异姿，蒙戎蔚佳色。\n青毡持与藉，重锦裁爲饰。\n卧阁幸相宜，温然承宴息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}